<div class="lu-row top" style="gap:14px"><span class="lu-kpi-l" style="margin-top:6px">Net revenue retention <button aria-label="Sobre" class="lu-btn icon ghost sm" type="button"><.icon name="info" /></button></span><div class="lu-pop pad" style="width:300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><b>Net revenue retention</b><span class="lu-small lu-muted">Receita de clientes existentes nos últimos 12 meses, incluindo expansão e descontando churn.</span><div class="lu-sep"></div><div class="lu-row lu-small" style="justify-content:space-between"><span class="lu-muted">Fórmula</span><code class="mono">(MRR₀ + exp − churn) / MRR₀</code></div><a class="lu-btn link sm" href="#">Saiba mais</a></div></div>
